---
title: Peixinhos da horta
description: The original tempura.
category: Starters
image: peixinhos-da-horta.jpeg
tags:
  - Portuguese
  - deep-fried
servings: 4
prep time: 20 minutes
cook time: 20 minutes
created: 2026-05-18
updated: 2026-05-18
---

Prepare @green beans{400%g} by trimming the ends and removing any strings. Boil them in salted water for ~{5%minutes}. Drain and let cool.

In a bowl, add the @self-rising flour{150%g}. Season with @salt{} and @black pepper{}. Add @eggs{2}, @olive oil{1%Tbsp}, and gradually pour in @sparkling water{100%ml}(chilled), whisking continuously until you get a smooth batter.

Heat plenty of @vegetable oil{} in a #deep pan{}.

Dip the green beans one by one into the batter, let the excess drip off slightly, then fry until golden brown.

Remove and drain excess oil using paper towels.

Serve hot, for example with a side of tomato rice.